{"id":723,"name":"dartrix","speciesId":723,"dex":723,"form":"normal","generation":7,"types":["grass","flying"],"stats":{"hp":78,"attack":75,"defense":75,"special-attack":70,"special-defense":70,"speed":52},"abilities":[{"name":"overgrow","hidden":false},{"name":"long-reach","hidden":true}],"height":7,"weight":160,"baseExp":147,"sprites":{"normal":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/other/official-artwork/723.png","shiny":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/other/official-artwork/shiny/723.png","icon":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/723.png"},"cry":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/723.ogg","genus":"Blade Quill Pokémon","genusPt":"Pokémon Pena Lâmina","flavor":[{"version":"sun","text":"A bit of a dandy, it spends its free time preening its wings. Its preoccupation with any dirt on its plumage can leave it unable to battle."},{"version":"moon","text":"It throws sharp feathers called blade quills at enemies or prey. It seldom misses."},{"version":"ultra-sun","text":"This narcissistic Pokémon is a clean freak. If you don’t groom it diligently, it will stop listening to you."},{"version":"ultra-moon","text":"Supremely sensitive to the presence of others, it can detect opponents standing behind it, flinging its sharp feathers to take them out."},{"version":"sword","text":"It throws one knifelike feather after another at its enemies, and each one precisely strikes a weak point. These feathers are known as blade quills."},{"version":"shield","text":"It never slacks when it comes to the task of cleaning its feathers. Thorough preening keeps it looking spiffy and its blade quills nice and sharp."},{"version":"legends-arceus","text":"Regularly basks in sunlight to gather power—presumably due to the frigid climate. Nonetheless, the edges of the blade quills set into its wings are keen as ever."}],"flavorPt":"Aquece-se regularmente à luz do sol para reunir energia – provavelmente devido ao clima frio. No entanto, as pontas das pontas das lâminas colocadas em suas asas estão mais afiadas do que nunca.","genderRate":1,"captureRate":45,"eggGroups":["flying"],"isLegendary":false,"isMythical":false,"evolution":{"species":"rowlet","speciesId":722,"evolvesTo":[{"conditions":["Nível 17"],"species":"dartrix","speciesId":723,"evolvesTo":[{"conditions":["Nível 34","Nível 36"],"species":"decidueye","speciesId":724,"evolvesTo":[]}]}]},"varieties":[{"id":723,"name":"dartrix","form":"normal","sprite":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/other/official-artwork/723.png"}],"games":[17,18,20,24,25],"moves":[{"id":14,"learn":[[17,"tm",0],[18,"tm",0],[20,"tm",0],[25,"tm",0]]},{"id":16,"learn":[[24,"lv",1]]},{"id":31,"learn":[[17,"lv",33],[18,"lv",33]]},{"id":33,"learn":[[17,"lv",1],[18,"lv",1],[20,"lv",1],[25,"lv",1]]},{"id":36,"learn":[[25,"tm",0]]},{"id":45,"learn":[[17,"lv",1],[17,"lv",4],[18,"lv",1],[18,"lv",4],[20,"lv",1],[25,"lv",1]]},{"id":64,"learn":[[17,"lv",1],[17,"lv",8],[18,"lv",1],[18,"lv",8],[20,"lv",9],[25,"lv",9]]},{"id":75,"learn":[[17,"lv",15],[18,"lv",14],[20,"lv",15],[25,"lv",15]]},{"id":76,"learn":[[17,"tm",0],[18,"tm",0],[20,"tm",0],[25,"tm",0]]},{"id":92,"learn":[[17,"tm",0],[18,"tm",0]]},{"id":101,"learn":[[25,"tm",0]]},{"id":104,"learn":[[17,"tm",0],[18,"tm",0],[25,"egg",0]]},{"id":109,"learn":[[25,"egg",0],[25,"tm",0]]},{"id":113,"learn":[[17,"tm",0],[18,"tm",0],[20,"tm",0],[25,"tm",0]]},{"id":114,"learn":[[25,"tm",0]]},{"id":129,"learn":[[20,"tm",0],[25,"tm",0]]},{"id":143,"learn":[[18,"tutor",0]]},{"id":156,"learn":[[17,"tm",0],[18,"tm",0],[20,"tm",0],[25,"tm",0]]},{"id":164,"learn":[[17,"tm",0],[18,"tm",0],[20,"tm",0],[25,"tm",0]]},{"id":173,"learn":[[18,"tutor",0],[20,"tm",0]]},{"id":182,"learn":[[17,"tm",0],[18,"tm",0],[20,"tm",0],[25,"tm",0]]},{"id":193,"learn":[[17,"lv",19],[18,"lv",19]]},{"id":202,"learn":[[18,"tutor",0],[20,"tm",0],[